<article class="env-lemma" id="0CJX">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CJX">Lemma <span data-tag="0CJX">106.6.7</span>.</a> The category $p : \mathcal{C} \to W_{spaces, {\acute{e}tale}}$ constructed in Remark <a href="/tag/0CJP" data-tag="0CJP">106.6.1</a> is a gerbe. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      In Lemma <a href="/tag/0CJU" data-tag="0CJU">106.6.4</a> we have seen that it is a stack in groupoids. Thus it remains to check conditions (2) and (3) of Stacks, Definition <a href="/tag/06NZ" data-tag="06NZ">8.11.1</a>. Condition (2) follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0CJV" data-tag="0CJV">106.6.5</a>. Condition (3) follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0CJW" data-tag="0CJW">106.6.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
